<title>JAPAN: Suncall to issue 35 mln Sfr warrant.</title>
<headline>Suncall to issue 35 mln Sfr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Suncall Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Kokusai Bank (Switzerland) Ltd</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Sumitomo Trust Bank</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   35 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 20.Nov.00</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> EXER FROM 4.Dec.96   EXER TO 6.Nov.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 18.Nov.96  INT PAY 20.Nov</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 1.Nov.96  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on November 1..</p>
</text>
